# BEGIN pages-only
# docs.everruns.com is still the old Cloudflare Pages project, built from this
# repo's dist/. It answers every old URL with one 301 to the same path under
# everruns.com/docs (Pages keeps the query and redirects even when a file
# exists at the path). check-live.mjs --old guards this. stage-worker-assets.mjs
# drops this block: in the Worker it would loop everruns.com/docs onto itself.
# Delete it only once a docs.everruns.com zone redirect rule replaces the
# Pages project (knowledge/ui/documentation.md).
/* https://everruns.com/docs/:splat 301
# END pages-only

# Redirect removed pages to closest relevant page. Paths are public URLs: the
# docs Worker serves dist/ under /docs (scripts/stage-worker-assets.mjs).
/docs/sre/runbooks/production-migrations/ /docs/sre/admin-container/ 301
/docs/sre/runbooks/production-migrations /docs/sre/admin-container/ 301
